trics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":11260,"like_count":16,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近和一些推友的聊天中，很自然挖掘出对方的sub属性，对方觉得你介绍上没写dom啊，咋突然变成dom呢？\n\n真正的dom总是在人群里，一眼看穿找到那些渴望臣服的sub。在聊天中不自然就会去引导、训诫、惩罚，从而激发sub“下贱”本质。\n\n如果还没遇到自己的主人不要灰心，会有一个男人发现你领导你使用你的！"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-08-22T02:01:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2090982718884794840"],"id":"2090982718884794840","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":4275,"like_count":11,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"突然发现身边的人都好好，最近见识了太多奇葩事，好的人真的吸引好的人，并互相坚定走下去，这需要很大的智慧跟勇气，但大多数人没有！\n爱情能否幸福的本质是你要找到一个本身就很好的人，而不是只对你好，更不用说利用人性的弱点和你的善良把你框住！\n一般人看到这种人，即使再大的利益，都会远离！ https://t.co/2z0iMLRgQf"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-08-27T21:58:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2093095763291353140"],"id":"2093095763291353140","in_reply_to_user_id":"1536902947871019008","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4287,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2093092105623347365","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@BTC_RAI 我不开啊，作为和孙哥曾经齐名，我二次出山就是要挑战没蓝V，能不能干到10万+粉"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:04:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092810413696245895"],"id":"2092810413696245895","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6439,"like_count":4,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"最近有点唠唠叨叨，希望不要不要被暗搓搓嫌弃！ https://t.co/tJ863BHzYA"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-08-24T15:57:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2091917854480462018"],"id":"2091917854480462018","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7765,"like_count":5,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今晚美股的QQQ应该是阶段低点了吧！"},{"author_id":"232201624","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:28:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2092318213313077554"],"id":"2092318213313077554","public_metrics":{"bookmark